# Channel [0, 0.2] x [0, 1] split at y = 0.5 into a porous layer (bottom) and a clear fluid (top)
#
# Boundaries and Interfaces
# bnd_b - bottom wall
# bnd_t - top wall
# bnd_lp, bnd_rp - left and right ends of the porous layer
# bnd_lf, bnd_rf - left and right ends of the clear fluid
# itf_m - interface at y = 0.5
#
# Domains
# dom_p - porous layer (y < 0.5)
# dom_f - clear fluid (y > 0.5)

# vertices
v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.2 0.0 0.0
v 0.2 0.5 0.0
v 0.2 1.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
v 0.0 0.5 0.0

# 1d groups
g bnd_b
l 1 2
g bnd_rp
l 2 3
g bnd_rf
l 3 4
g bnd_t
l 4 5
g bnd_lf
l 5 6
g bnd_lp
l 6 1
g itf_m
l 3 6

# 2d groups
g dom_p
l 1 2 3 6 1
g dom_f
l 6 3 4 5 6
